  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program Quality enhancement through targeted capacity building to Oxfam Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Quality (PQ) quality enhancement initiatives which focuses on building capacity of both Monitoring and Evaluation, Accountability and Learning (MEAL) and Partners around essential themes and topics which are crucial for delivering high quality program. The proposed initiative will therefore focus at building capacity of the country MEAL teams to ensure high quality data management, visualization and reporting, while taking into consideration foundational/crosscutting themes such as Gender, protection and feminist approaches which are highly sensitive and difficult to implement in the context of Yemen. Learning from these initiatives will be documented to add to enhance programming and contribute to the body of knowledge in the area of program quality Assurance.</narrative>
  </description>
